<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,250 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,250 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,250 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,200 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 26	 November 25</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,250		15,200</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.351 million	  $2.907 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
